 "name_en": "Invoice, Taxes and Complementary Postings (1J5)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Invoice, Taxes and Complementary Postings (1J5)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The system automatically generates a nota fiscal invoice in Logistics Invoice Verification for a service you procured. The nota fiscal serves as the basis for statutory reporting. You can use the Nota Fiscal Writer to create, change, or display a nota fiscal. You can also process manual payments online (Accounts Receivable) as a manual alternative for FSN replacement.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage Nota Fiscal (NF)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate RPS number (Provisory Service Receipt)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Fill service Nota Fiscal number given by local authorities</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Complete service Nota Fiscal with NBS code</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create outgoing service Nota Fiscal (manual)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Cancel manual service NF Writer</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Use Incoming NF Writer (for goods or services)</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create Nota Fiscal or electronic fiscal documents manually</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Display or change a Nota Fiscal (manually or automatically generated)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print or reprint a Nota Fiscal</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Cancel a Nota Fiscal that was created in the NF Writer</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>发票、税收和补充过账 (1J5)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">系统在物流发票校验中为采购的服务自动生成发票。发票用作法定报表的基础。您可以使用发票编写器创建、更改或显示发票。您还可以在线处理手动付款（应收账款）作为 FSN 替换的手动备选项。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">管理发票 (NF)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">生成 RPS 编号（临时服务收据）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">填充地方当局提供的服务发票编号</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用 NBS 代码完成服务发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建付款服务发票（手动）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">取消手动服务发票编写器</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用采购发票编写器（针对货物或服务）</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioeca64ba3613546eb94b62492cd3ff82f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">手动创建发票或电子会计凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">显示或更改发票（手动或自动生成）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印或重新打印发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">取消在 NF 编写器中创建的发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "name_zh": "发票、税收和补充过账 (1J5)",
